  "name": "Tinker: Stim Augmentation heals allies when the Tinker carries only a gun (#10720)",
  "contract": "Stim Augmentation (653239) puts enchant 9997 on the equipped gun, whose equip spell 653240 reads 'causing your direct healing abilities to heal up to 3 nearby allies for an additional 20% of the amount healed'. Its script casts 653241 (SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL, TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_ALLY, chain 3) on each direct heal's target. Spell.dbc gives 653241 EquippedItemClass 2 with subclass mask 173555, which holds melee weapons but not guns, so a Tinker carrying only the gun the augmentation needs had every Stim heal rejected, while the same setup with the starting main-hand weapon heals. A level 60 Tinker whose starting main-hand weapon is destroyed equips only a gun, applies the augmentation and casts Zap! (681298, an instant direct heal) on a wounded grouped ally: the ally must take both the Zap! heal and a Stim heal 653241. Issue #10720.",
